--- !u!114 &4893908126153709187
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4653939491283774447}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38044fae8c08c964795d52821717ff1f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  popupPrefab: {fileID: 6605906386198019864, guid: 6a1f08d05e23e9845aa558c8277c7325, type: 3}
  popupParent: {fileID: 2973395731717958267}
  typeSpeed: 0.025
  visibleTime: 3.5
  driftSpeed: 0.25
  localDriftDirection: {x: 0, y: 1, z: 0}
  failedLines:
  - WHAT THE FUCK HAPPENED TO MY VASE
  - This was a birthday cake. Now it's floor paste. :/
  - I ordered flowers, not botanical shrapnel.
  - The box is empty. The box is also on fire. Impressive.
  - Security, please escort this delivery goblin out of my airspace.
  - My antique lamp is now a glitter cloud. Fucking fantastic.
  - Did you fly through an asteroid field or personally hate me?
  - The package is gone. Not damaged. Gone.
  - I am going to complain so hard your ship insurance feels it.
  - You somehow delivered less than nothing.
  barelyDeliveredLines:
  - This is barely recognizable, thanks I guess... for nothing.
  - Technically delivered. Emotionally destroyed.
  - I can identify maybe 12 percent of this sandwich.
  - The vase survived as a concept.
  - This package has the structural integrity of wet cereal.
  - I ordered a chair. You brought me chair ingredients.
  - I mean... I can probably scrape the pizza off the lid.
  - The flowers are alive. The pot is not.
  - I am accepting this only because I don't have the energy to sue.
  - Congratulations, you delivered debris with confidence.
  damagedLines:
  - How am I meant to make my shovel with this broken pipe?
  - The box says fragile. You did see that part, right?
  - There are dents on the dents.
  - My burrito has been compressed into a fuel pellet.
  - This was a mirror. It now shows every angle at once.
  - The package is making a noise it was not making earlier.
  - I ordered computer parts, not modern art.
  - 'Good news: it arrived. Bad news: it arrived angry.'
  - Did you use my delivery as a bumper?
  - My noodles are distributed evenly throughout the bag. Great.
  goodLines:
  - Very nice, I have a chair.
  - Acceptable. Alarmingly acceptable.
  - Only minor cosmic bruising. Approved.
  - Honestly? Better than the last guy.
  - The package is mostly fine, which is more than I expected.
  - No visible fire. Five stars.
  - The pizza is only slightly diagonal. I'll take it.
  - Good delivery. Weird flying, but good delivery.
  - I expected worse. That is technically praise.
  - Package received. Mildly traumatized, but received.
  perfectLines:
  - Not bad kid, not bad.
  - Holy shit, it's actually intact.
  - No dents? No burns? Are you even a real courier?
  - Package received in perfect condition. Suspicious.
  - The vase survived. I owe someone an apology.
  - You delivered this smoother than my divorce lawyer.
  - That was clean. Don't let it go to your head.
  - Perfect delivery. I hate that I'm impressed.
  - The cake still looks like cake. Incredible technology.
  - Courier performed above legal expectations.
